OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786198692
OL,3,CWasted medicines cost NHS #480m a year
OL,4,Cand 'could fill 75 swimming pools'
OL,6,FA year's worth of wasted medicines
OL,7,Fthrown away in England could fill 75
OL,8,Fswimming pools, pharmacies have said.
OL,10,FThe National Pharmacy Association
OL,11,F(NPA) has estimated that 3,400 tonnes
OL,12,Fof partially used medicines were
OL,13,Fbinned in England from 2024 to 2025.
OL,15,FThe NPA, which analyses data from
OL,16,Flocal health bodies, estimates that
OL,17,Fwasted medicine costs the NHS at least
OL,18,F#480 million a year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
