OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786198692
OL,3,CWasted medicines cost NHS #480m a year
OL,4,Cand 'could fill 75 swimming pools'
OL,6,F"Wasted medicines cost the NHS
OL,7,Fsignificant sums of money every year
OL,8,Fthat could be invested in better
OL,9,Fservices for patients," said Olivier
OL,10,FPicard, chairman of the National
OL,11,FPharmacy Association.
OL,13,F"More than this, wasting medicines can
OL,14,Fhave environmental and health
OL,15,Fconsequences and we can do much more
OL,16,Fto tackle this growing problem.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@WO]uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786198692
OL,3,CWasted medicines cost NHS #480m a year
OL,4,Cand 'could fill 75 swimming pools'
OL,6,F"As soon as a medicine leaves a
OL,7,Fpharmacy, even if it is not used and
OL,8,Fis unopened, it must be disposed of so
OL,9,Fit is important patients only get
OL,10,Fmedicines they are sure they will use."
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
