OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786198692
OL,3,CWasted medicines cost NHS #480m a year
OL,4,Cand 'could fill 75 swimming pools'
OL,6,FThe NPA represents some 6,000
OL,7,Findependent community pharmacies in
OL,8,Fthe UK, and is calling for patients
OL,9,Fwith several repeat prescriptions to
OL,10,Fhave more reviews so medicines that
OL,11,Fare no longer needed can be identified.
OL,13,FIt also urged the public not to "over
OL,14,Forder" medicine and only have a repeat
OL,15,Fprescription when needed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786198692
OL,3,CWasted medicines cost NHS #480m a year
OL,4,Cand 'could fill 75 swimming pools'
OL,6,FCommenting, Dr Rasha Abdelsalam
OL,7,FElshenawy, senior lecturer in
OL,8,Fpostgraduate medicine at the
OL,9,FUniversity of Hertfordshire, said:
OL,10,F"Medicines waste isn't only a
OL,11,Ffinancial and environmental problem `
OL,12,Fit's a patient safety and resistance
OL,13,Fproblem.
OL,15,F"Leftover antibiotics kept at home are
OL,16,Foften taken later without medical
OL,17,Fadvice, which fuels antimicrobial
OL,18,Fresistance, one of the biggest threats
OL,19,Fto modern medicine.
OL,26,@rD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786198692
OL,3,CWasted medicines cost NHS #480m a year
OL,4,Cand 'could fill 75 swimming pools'
OL,6,F"Regular medication reviews and only
OL,7,Fordering what is needed protects
OL,8,Fpatients, the NHS and the environment."
OL,10,FAn NHS England spokesperson said: "The
OL,11,FNHS has taken action to ensure people
OL,12,Fcan better manage their prescriptions
OL,13,Fon their mobile phones through the NHS
OL,14,Fapp including repeat prescriptions.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@gO]rD@cOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
