OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786198692
OL,3,CWasted medicines cost NHS #480m a year
OL,4,Cand 'could fill 75 swimming pools'
OL,6,F"We know there is more to do which is
OL,7,Fwhy several local NHS services are
OL,8,Frunning campaigns to reduce medicines
OL,9,Fwaste, alongside wider efforts to
OL,10,Foptimise medicines use that have also
OL,11,Fseen the total number of dependency
OL,12,Fforming medications prescribed fall
OL,13,Fover the last decade."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@VO]
